                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I initially reviewed this game after 5 hours because I had failed a few times but figured I had seen enough of the game. This led me to think I could be done with the game...however, I just could not let it go or get it out of my head. I had to beat it. So I jumped back in, failed a few more times but learned a lot more. I am very happy that I saw this game through to the end - it was satisfying to build my kingdom and protect the crown. Overall, I had a great experience and loved the artstyle.",
